{"2607420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cat Life Simulator", "steam_appid": 2607420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/a91c3532af30031bbb5c6ab89372e7d9.avif?t=1781536992\" width=618 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the cat. Live by your own rules 🐱<br><br>In Cat Life Simulator, you step into the carefree and unpredictable life of a real street cat. Explore a lively open world where every house, alley, and rooftop can lead to a new adventure… or get you kicked out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between three unique cats and personalize your look with fun accessories like collars, bows, and quirky hats. Roam the city freely and interact with the world however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/d029263d19e1e9eab34f6205071a5f70.poster.avif?t=1781536992\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/d029263d19e1e9eab34f6205071a5f70.webm?t=1781536992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/d029263d19e1e9eab34f6205071a5f70.mp4?t=1781536992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 Realistic Cat Behavior<br>Scratch furniture, nap wherever you want, purr happily, and knock things over - just be a cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/74e3cd209e060891514f7e56af2edcf4.poster.avif?t=1781536992\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/74e3cd209e060891514f7e56af2edcf4.webm?t=1781536992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/74e3cd209e060891514f7e56af2edcf4.mp4?t=1781536992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏙 Explore a Vibrant Open World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter houses, climb rooftops, wander through alleys, and discover new places across the city. But remember: every home has an owner, and not everyone welcomes surprise visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/83e2cf4a40e983bcbdb116bdedad5884.poster.avif?t=1781536992\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/83e2cf4a40e983bcbdb116bdedad5884.webm?t=1781536992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/83e2cf4a40e983bcbdb116bdedad5884.mp4?t=1781536992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐶 Animal Missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with or compete against other animals in unique quests across the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 Interact With People</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach anyone you meet - beg for food, charm them with your cuteness, or simply get in their way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/371363a7db07ff458acd0226b2fffa6c.poster.avif?t=1781536992\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/371363a7db07ff458acd0226b2fffa6c.webm?t=1781536992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/371363a7db07ff458acd0226b2fffa6c.mp4?t=1781536992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Hidden Treasures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the city to collect hidden items scattered throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own story as a street cat and turn everyday chaos into adventure. Are you ready to become a true street legend? 🐾</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/a91c3532af30031bbb5c6ab89372e7d9.avif?t=1781536992\" width=618 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the cat. Live by your own rules 🐱<br><br>In Cat Life Simulator, you step into the carefree and unpredictable life of a real street cat. Explore a lively open world where every house, alley, and rooftop can lead to a new adventure… or get you kicked out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between three unique cats and personalize your look with fun accessories like collars, bows, and quirky hats. Roam the city freely and interact with the world however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/d029263d19e1e9eab34f6205071a5f70.poster.avif?t=1781536992\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/d029263d19e1e9eab34f6205071a5f70.webm?t=1781536992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/d029263d19e1e9eab34f6205071a5f70.mp4?t=1781536992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 Realistic Cat Behavior<br>Scratch furniture, nap wherever you want, purr happily, and knock things over - just be a cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/74e3cd209e060891514f7e56af2edcf4.poster.avif?t=1781536992\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/74e3cd209e060891514f7e56af2edcf4.webm?t=1781536992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/74e3cd209e060891514f7e56af2edcf4.mp4?t=1781536992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏙 Explore a Vibrant Open World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter houses, climb rooftops, wander through alleys, and discover new places across the city. But remember: every home has an owner, and not everyone welcomes surprise visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/83e2cf4a40e983bcbdb116bdedad5884.poster.avif?t=1781536992\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/83e2cf4a40e983bcbdb116bdedad5884.webm?t=1781536992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/83e2cf4a40e983bcbdb116bdedad5884.mp4?t=1781536992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐶 Animal Missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with or compete against other animals in unique quests across the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 Interact With People</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach anyone you meet - beg for food, charm them with your cuteness, or simply get in their way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/371363a7db07ff458acd0226b2fffa6c.poster.avif?t=1781536992\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/371363a7db07ff458acd0226b2fffa6c.webm?t=1781536992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/371363a7db07ff458acd0226b2fffa6c.mp4?t=1781536992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔎 Hidden Treasures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the city to collect hidden items scattered throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own story as a street cat and turn everyday chaos into adventure. Are you ready to become a true street legend? 🐾</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Cat Life Simulator is a realistic simulation game that allows you to see the world through the eyes of a cat. Explore the world, interact with the environment, and create your own cat's story. Your adventure begins in a domestic setting, but over time, you will discover many other places.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/f109dff1654afcfd2f888d2e76bb15475e7fd548/header.jpg?t=1781536992", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/99f4aa808f1ed6fbd2deb18e4d00ea06a0fa860b/capsule